.TH SYS-DOCTOR 1 "October 2026" "devtools-hub 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sys-doctor \- run automated POSIX system health diagnostics and resource audits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sys-doctor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sys-doctor
inspects underlying operating system kernels, evaluates CPU load averages, calculates root partition disk utilization percentages, and scans for lingering zombie processes across Unix environments.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All system diagnostics passed health thresholds successfully.
.TP
.B 1
Critical resource exhaustion detected (e.g., root partition disk usage exceeding 90%).
